So, if you have any problem of any kind, you just have to ask yourself

00:018:29.000 --> 00:018:30.000
why do I have this problem?

00:018:30.000 --> 00:018:34.000
And you have to dig and find out why and remove the

00:018:34.000 --> 00:018:35.000
reasons.

00:018:35.000 --> 00:018:37.000
You have to be honest with yourself.

